WEBVTT

00:07:59.036 --> 00:08:01.156
I'll explain what I mean
in this photograph.

00:08:01.156 --> 00:08:03.476
This hotel, it's a beautiful building.

00:08:03.516 --> 00:08:06.036
There’s downstairs seating.
There’s upstairs seating.

00:08:06.076 --> 00:08:10.636
There's beautiful staircases everywhere,
but unfortunately, there isn't a lift.

00:08:11.516 --> 00:08:14.356
The restaurant itself is run
by an outside catering company.

00:08:14.356 --> 00:08:16.756
It's not their fault there's no lift.

00:08:16.796 --> 00:08:19.436
It's not their building,
they're just renting the space.

00:08:19.436 --> 00:08:23.156
However, if you're in a wheelchair,
you can't use the upstairs seating.

00:08:24.036 --> 00:08:28.436
But if there was a sign near the entrance
saying something like,

00:08:28.436 --> 00:08:32.836
"Patrons in wheelchairs, please note
that although we've got upstairs seating,